(4. Conservation Laws and Symmetries) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.18 rg
(By Noether's theorem, spatial translation symmetry yields linear momentum conservation,) Tj T*
(rotational symmetry yields angular momentum conservation, and time invariance) Tj T*
(guarantees conservation of total mechanical energy.) Tj T*
